  "snippet": "ReliefWeb has registered the Mayon Volcano eruption as a formal disaster event with GLIDE number VO-2026-000065-PHL. The 125-day continuous effusive eruption has now caused measurable humanitarian impact: 1,039ha rice + 191ha other crops damaged by ashfall, 158km roads affected. Health authorities in Guinobatan report respiratory cases. Alert Level 3 maintained by PHIVOLCS. PhilSA Sentinel-2 satellite data used for crop damage mapping.",
